cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "agent-sidecar: governed AI agents as a Kubernetes sidecar"
abstract: >-
  agent-sidecar runs governed AI agents next to any service on Kubernetes.
  The app calls its sidecar on localhost over HTTP or gRPC, with no SDK.
  Every model call, tool call and service call is authorized against a YAML
  charter, bounded by budgets and guardrails, and written as one JSONL audit
  record. Services authenticate each other with mTLS and SPIFFE identities.
authors:
